	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Amphenol RJE1D18821401 shielded RJ45 8P8C jack, right-angle THT, tab-down, no LEDs, no magnetics.  Layout along Y-axis (KiCad +Y = down, PCB edge below origin, receptacle opening off the edge at +Y): plastic locating pegs at Y=0 (origin datum, 10.00 mm spacing); shield tails Ø1.57 at Y=+6.79 (14.85 mm spacing, GND); PCB edge at Y=+8.8 (dashed reference on Dwgs.User).  Pin block above origin: front row (odd 1,3,5,7) Ø0.9 at Y=-3.96; back row (even 2,4,6,8) Ø0.9 at Y=-6.50.  Rows staggered by 1.27 mm in X.  Pin 1 at (-4.445, -3.96), pin 8 at (+4.445, -6.50).  Corrected 2026-07-18 from the original draft which had all Y coordinates negated -- caused the connector to sit backwards relative to the board edge.  Datasheet: p-rje1d-188-x1x01.pdf.")
	(tags "amphenol rje1d18821401 rj45 8p8c shielded modular jack thru-hole right-angle cat5e")
